# 4. Understand `/etc/passwd`

A line looks like:

```text
adminuser:x:1001:1001::/home/adminuser:/bin/bash
```

The fields are:

```text
1       2   3    4    5    6                 7
│       │   │    │    │    │                 │
User    │   UID  GID  Info Home              Shell
        │
        Password placeholder
```

So:

```text
username     = adminuser
UID          = 1001
GID          = 1001
home         = /home/adminuser
shell        = /bin/bash
```

