# 32. Understanding Password Aging

Example:

```text
Maximum password age: 90 days
Minimum password age: 1 day
Warning period: 7 days
```

This means:

```text
Password changed
       |
       +---- 83 days
       |
       +---- warning begins
       |
       +---- 90 days
       |
       +---- password expires
```

